<span id="S1.T1.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><math id="S1.T1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="S1.T1.3.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S1.T1.3.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(queries)</span></span>
<span id="S1.T1.3.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><math id="S1.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.3.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">–</span><math id="S1.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">5</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></th>
<td id="S1.T1.3.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.45pt;padding-bottom:0.45pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:173.6pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:173.6pt;"><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">A code-centric request sequence.
</span><math id="S1.T1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{0}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> (</span><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">context</span><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">) asks the </span><math id="S1.T1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{LLM}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝖫𝖫𝖬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{LLM}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> to read and explain a given code snippet.
</span><math id="S1.T1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> queries the functionality of a specific function;
</span><math id="S1.T1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> queries variable roles and data flow;
</span><math id="S1.T1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{3}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> queries invariants or assumptions;
</span><math id="S1.T1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">4</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{4}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> queries potential corner cases;
and </span><math id="S1.T1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">5</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{5}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.3.2.2.1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> queries possible optimizations.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.3.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S1.T1.3.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.45pt;padding-bottom:0.45pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:37.0pt;">
